stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Off

    Off --> Starting: Start discovery mode
    Starting --> Active: Initial queue built and playback started
    Starting --> Off: Library lookup failed

    Active --> Active: Excerpt not elapsed
    Active --> Active: Append future songs
    Active --> Active: Prune old backlog
    Active --> Active: Manual next
    Active --> MixDialogHold: Generate mix from current discovery song
    Active --> ExternalPlaybackStopped: Current playback not in Discovery queue
    Active --> Off: Stop discovery mode
    Active --> Off: Kodi player stopped

    MixDialogHold --> Active: Cancel and dialog time < excerpt length
    MixDialogHold --> Active: Cancel and dialog time >= excerpt length / skip next
    MixDialogHold --> MixPlayback: Confirm mix creation

    MixPlayback --> Off: Discovery stopped, mix playing

    ExternalPlaybackStopped --> Off: stop_reason=external_playback

    Off --> [*]
